Parser: reject a bare `yield` as the left operand of an operator (`(yield >> x)`); the
formatter dropped the parentheses and produced code that does not parse.
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-parser-yield-binary-operand.py (ruff_formatter_validity).

